# Scenario 'mail_server_full': メールサーバ (server mail management) with five messages on the fake POP3 server. Run 1 = "かくにんしてから
# けす": connect (USER/PASS/STAT/TOP per mail), then for each mail the icon bar of the check screen: mail 1 delete (first icon, A), mail 2
# skip (RIGHT, A), mail 3 delete, mail 4 skip, mail 5 end (RIGHT x2, A), result screens. Run 2 = "ぜんぶけす" (delete everything): the confirmation
# is refused once ("いいえ" is the default), then accepted (LEFT, A): connect, POP3 DELE of the remaining mails, result screens.
# Starts from the state left by 'mail_inbox'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x5
wait 30
tap A                        # メールサーバ
waitstable 60 max 600
shot server_notice
tap A                        # OK (first-use notice)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot server_menu
tap A                        # かくにんしてからけす
waitstable 60 max 600
shot check_confirm
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # 0でつうしんをはじめる
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1500
shot check_mail1
tap A                        # delete mail 1
wait 900
shot check_mail2
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A                        # skip mail 2
wait 900
shot check_mail3
tap A                        # delete mail 3
wait 900
shot check_mail4
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A                        # skip mail 4
wait 900
shot check_mail5
tap RIGHT x2
wait 30
tap A                        # end
wait 900
shot check_end
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot check_result_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot check_result_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot back_in_mail_menu
# --- run 2: ぜんぶけす (the mail menu cursor is still on メールサーバ)
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot server_notice_2
tap A                        # OK
waitstable 60 max 600
shot server_menu_2
tap DOWN
wait 40
shot server_menu_2_down
tap A                        # じどうでぜんぶけす
waitstable 60 max 600
shot all_confirm
tap A                        # "いいえ" (default)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot all_refused
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap LEFT
wait 40
tap A                        # "はい"
waitstable 60 max 600
shot all_confirm_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1500
shot all_deleting
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot all_result_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot all_result_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot end
